                "| Q5 Signal L144-28M | < 1.0 dB | ≥ 20 dB | 25 / 75 / 150 W | [9]",
                "| HA1YA ME2T-PRO-II / ME2HT-PRO-II | 1.0 dB | ≤ 25 dB（可调） | 30 / 50 W | [10]",
