                "[6] Down East Microwave, “L144-28 Rev B” – उपयोगकर्ता गाइड (विनिर्देश: NF < 1.0 dB, कन्वर्ज़न गेन ≥ 17 dB के साथ) – https://manualmachine.com/demi/l14428revb/26842141-user-guide",
                "[7] Kuhne electronic, “TR 144 H +40” – उपयोगकर्ता मैनुअल – https://manuals.online/kuhne-electronic/transceiver/tr-144-h-40/user-manual/191pa",
