                "[16] Giorgio Marchi IK1UWL, “EME (Earth-Moon-Earth) – Guida operativa”, जनवरी 2012, § 4 “Sequenziamento relè, PA e PRE”, IC8TEM द्वारा उपलब्ध कराया गया – http://www.qsl.net/ik3xtv",
